          "type": "UInt"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Override Format",
          "type": "EPixelFormat"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Force Linear Gamma",
          "type": "Bool"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Initialize the settings needed to create a render target texture\nand create its resource\n@param\tInSizeX - width of the texture\n@param\tInSizeY - height of the texture\n@param\tInFormat - format of the texture\n@param\tbInForceLinearGame - forces render target to use linear gamma space"
    },
    {
      "id": "init-auto-format",
