    {
      "id": "construct-texture-2-d",
      "name": "ConstructTexture2D",
      "category": "TextureRenderTarget2D",
      "signature": "ConstructTexture2D(Target, In Outer, In New Texture Name, In Object Flags, In Flags, In Alpha Override)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UTextureRenderTarget2D*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Outer",
          "type": "UObject*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In New Texture Name",
          "type": "String&"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Object Flags",
          "type": "EObjectFlags"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Flags",
          "type": "UInt",
          "default": "CTF_Default"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Alpha Override",
          "type": "TArray<uint8>*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UTexture2D*",
      "docs": "Utility for creating a new UTexture2D from a UTextureRenderTarget2D\n@param InOuter - Outer to use when constructing the new UTexture2D.\n@param InNewTextureName - Name of new UTexture2D object.\n@param InObjectFlags - Flags to apply to the new UTexture2D object\n@param InFlags - Various control flags for operation (see EConstructTextureFlags)\n@param InAlphaOverride - If specified, the values here will become the alpha values in the resulting texture\n@return New UTexture2D object."
